Package: zephyr
Architecture: all
Depends:
    python3,
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-language CLI project templates and helper tools
 zephyr ships language templates for small command-line utilities under
 /usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/, each with a some_puff1 example application,
 plus cmdline tools (zephyr, zephyr-rename, zephyr-add, zephyr-remove)
 to instantiate, rename, and manage puffs.
